<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Jack Barnard — Portfolio</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>
    <header class="hero">
        <img src="jack.JPG" alt="Jack Barnard" class="profile-photo">
        <h1>Jack Barnard</h1>
        <p class="tagline">MEng Electrical & Electronic Engineering • Embedded Systems • Hardware Design</p>
    </header>

    <section class="intro">
        <h2>About Me</h2>

        <p>
            I’m an engineer with a strong focus on hardware, embedded systems, and digital design.
            My work spans FPGA development, low‑level programming, and building reliable technical
            systems that bridge hardware and software. I enjoy solving complex engineering problems
            and creating elegant, efficient solutions.
        </p>

        <p>
            I’m currently studying for an MEng in Electrical and Electronic Engineering, building
            experience across digital logic, embedded architectures, and systems engineering. I’ve
            also been active within engineering societies, contributing to technical projects and
            collaborative development environments.
        </p>

        <p>
            My interests include FPGA design, computer architecture, embedded C/C++, digital systems,
            and practical electronics. I’m driven by curiosity, hands‑on experimentation, and a desire
            to build systems that are both technically robust and thoughtfully engineered.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="projects">
        <h2>Projects</h2>
        <p>Explore my work at <strong>jack-barnard.com/projectname</strong></p>

        <div class="project-list">
            <a class="project-card" href="/fpga-vga">
                <h3>FPGA VGA Driver</h3>
                <p>Digital design project using SystemVerilog and DE1‑SoC hardware.</p>
            </a>

            <a class="project-card" href="/embedded-audio">
                <h3>Embedded Audio Tools</h3>
                <p>Audio signal generation and processing on microcontrollers.</p>
            </a>

            <a class="project-card" href="/robotics">
                <h3>Robotics Outreach</h3>
                <p>Engineering education and robotics demonstrations.</p>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 Jack Barnard</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
